    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Between is a text-based roguelike RPG that plunges you into a haunting realm of forgotten gods, living nightmares, and shifting memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters who enter the Between encounter reflections of themselves.. confrontations with personal history and decisions made in their journeys. Each individual's story contributes to the fabric of the Between, a fabric that pulses quietly with nostalgia, sadness, beauty, and profound reflection.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 skill evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave like enemy combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ distinct enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 powerful boss-like enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events that dramatically alter your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich, immersive lore to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paragon enemies with challenging modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom skill creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique run collectables for power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specific interactions per player.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Between is a text-based roguelike RPG that plunges you into a haunting realm of forgotten gods, living nightmares, and shifting memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters who enter the Between encounter reflections of themselves.. confrontations with personal history and decisions made in their journeys. Each individual's story contributes to the fabric of the Between, a fabric that pulses quietly with nostalgia, sadness, beauty, and profound reflection.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 skill evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave like enemy combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ distinct enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 powerful boss-like enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events that dramatically alter your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich, immersive lore to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paragon enemies with challenging modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom skill creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique run collectables for power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specific interactions per player.</p></li></ul>",
